{% comment %}
  05 — THE ART OF PERFUMERY
{% endcomment %}

<section class="section-padding border-top-thin" id="art">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);" class="gsap-reveal">
      <span class="editorial-label">05 — CRAFT & ORIGIN</span>
      <h2 class="headline-section font-serif" style="margin-top: 12px;">THE ART OF PERFUMERY</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="art-steps-grid gsap-reveal">
      <div class="art-step-card">
        <span class="art-step-num">01</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif" style="font-size: 1.5rem;">BOTANICAL EXTRACTION</h3>
        <p class="text-soft" style="font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.7;">
          We harvest rare flowers and resins at peak potency—wild iris from Florence, pink pepper from Madagascar, and wild agarwood from Assam. Cold-pressed to retain fragile olfactory notes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="art-step-card">
        <span class="art-step-num">02</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif" style="font-size: 1.5rem;">90-DAY MACERATION</h3>
        <p class="text-soft" style="font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.7;">
          Unpolished raw extraits age in dark obsidian vessels for 90 days. This controlled maturation allows top, heart, and base notes to fuse into a seamless sensory composition.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="art-step-card">
        <span class="art-step-num">03</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif" style="font-size: 1.5rem;">FLACON ARTISANSHIP</h3>
        <p class="text-soft" style="font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.7;">
          Each heavy-glass bottle is hand-polished, individually numbered, and capped with solid magnetic obsidian glass to protect the living elixir within from UV degradation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
